    {
      "id": "677f92079d50b992",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### BUDDHAGHOSA’S COMMENTARY ON THE DHAMMASANGANI\n\nTHE FIRST BOOK OF THE ABHIDHAMMA PITAKA\n\n>",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "908aba7b1a96d897",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Abhidammaṃ paṭibāhento imasmiṃ janacakke pahāraṃ deti",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 220,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "186d6493783f2269",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ābhidhammikabhikkhūyeva kira dhammakathikā nāma, avasesā dhammakatthaṃ kathentāpi na dhammakathaṃ. - [atthasālinī Nidānakathā]",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 220,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "8d7131e815a14ba4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ābhidhammaka\n# bhikhū +\n# ya + eva\n**ya**: which; what; whatever. (relative pron.)\nĐại từ quan hệ",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1880,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "4f69c91f7de600a5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# avasesa \n1 adj. **remaining; rest of** [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=avases%C4%81%09#avasesa_1)\n\n[avasesa 2](https://dpdict.net/?q=avases%C4%81%09#avasesa_2) masc. **remainder; rest** [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=avases%C4%81%09#avasesa_2)",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2760,
      "y": -840,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 138
    },
    {
      "id": "d03036f10e33cb87",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Buddhaghosa's commentary [Chú giải của Ngài Buddhaghosa] on the Dhammasanganippakarana [Tập 1 - It is the first of the seven texts of the [Abhidhamma Pitaka] - Bộ Pháp Tụ] of the Abhidhamma Pitaka [Tạng vi diệu Pháp]. \n\n---\n [The Nidānakathā, or Introduction to the Jātaka Stories published on Ancient-Buddhist-Texts.net: Why you should read it](https://discourse.suttacentral.net/t/the-nidanakatha-or-introduction-to-the-jataka-stories-published-on-ancient-buddhist-texts-net-why-you-should-read-it/18168)",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 3920,
      "y": -900,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "b89f195e1ba5dc68",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ābhidhammikabhikhūyeva kira dhammakathikā nāma, avasesā dhammakatthaṃ   na dhammakathaṃ. - [atthasālinī Nidānakathā]",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 3260,
      "y": -900,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "9eb9ec3b225975ae",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# kattha\n[kattha 2.1](https://dpdict.net/?q=Kattha%E1%B9%83%09#kattha_2_1) nt. **timber, piece of wood** [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=Kattha%E1%B9%83%09#kattha_2_1)\nwood prepared for use in building and carpentry.\n\n\"the exploitation of forests for timber\"",
