      "text": "# Nāma\n[nāma 1](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_1) ind. **certainly; truly; for sure** [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_1)\n\n[nāma 2](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_2) ind. **called; means; by the name of; namely**; lit. name [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_2)\n\n[nāma 3](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_3) nt. **name** [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_3)\n\n[nāma 4](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_4) nt. **mental objects of consciousness; mentality; mental factors of feeling, perception, intention, contact and attention**; lit. name [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_4)\n\n[nāma 5](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_5) adj. **called; named**; lit. name [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_5)\n\n[nāma 6](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_6) ind. **normally; usually** [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_6)\n\n[nāma 7](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_7) nt. **(gram) noun; substantive**; lit. name [►](https://dpdict.net/?q=n%C4%81ma%09#n%C4%81ma_7)",
